{% elif page == "privacy" %}
<main class="wrap narrow" id="main">
  <div class="plain-hero"><h1>Privacy</h1><p class="lede">How {{ p.name }} uses your details.</p></div>
  <section class="prose" style="padding-bottom:40px">
    <p><strong>What we collect.</strong> When you place an order on this site we collect your name, your phone number, what you ordered, the date you want it and any note you add. If you choose delivery or shipping, we also collect your delivery address and PIN code. We don't use cookies for tracking and we don't run ads. We never ask for Aadhaar, PAN or bank details.</p>
    <p><strong>Why.</strong> Only to prepare your order and contact you about it (to confirm timing, delivery and payment).</p>
    <p><strong>Who sees it.</strong> Your order, including your delivery address, is sent by email to {{ p.name }} and shown to {{ p.name }} on their orders page. Nobody else can see your address: it is never shown on this website, and it is not in the reports or logs that LaunchWitness keeps about the shop. It is stored securely by the service that runs this website, LaunchWitness, so the order isn't lost. We never sell or share your details for marketing.</p>
    <p><strong>Payments.</strong> This site does not take payments. If you pay by UPI, the payment happens in your own UPI app.</p>
    <p><strong>How long.</strong> Only as long as needed to handle your order and keep the shop's records. If the shop is deleted, its orders, including addresses, are deleted with it.</p>
    <p><strong>Your choice.</strong> To see, correct or delete your details, contact us{% if p.phone %} on {{ p.phone }}{% endif %}{% if whatsapp_url %} or <a href="{{ whatsapp_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">on WhatsApp</a>{% endif %}.</p>
  </section>
</main>
{% endif %}

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <span>© {{ p.name }}{% if place %} · {{ place }}{% endif %}{% if p.fssai_number %} · FSSAI licence no. {{ p.fssai_number }}{% endif %}</span>
    <span><a href="{{ base }}/privacy">Privacy</a>{% if not preview and not demo %} · <a href="/report-shop" rel="nofollow">Report this shop</a>{% endif %} · Site by LaunchWitness</span>
  </div>
</footer>
